<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed mixed in heavy trading.</p>
<p>The Amex index closed at 589.24, up 1.40.</p>
<p>Losers beat winners 274 to 236.</p>
<p>The average price per share was up $0.04.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 26,355,210 compared with 21,676,125 on Monday.</p>
<p>	  (Prices official as of 1645 EST/2145 GMT)</p>
